      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Anti-inflammatory treatment, mainly with inhaled corticosteroids, is the cornerstone of asthma therapy. There are a number of new more specific therapies based on a molecular approach. Despite some promising results from some novel molecular therapies there are also some studies which have shown no effect of these treatments."},
